."},{"term":"ROE / ROA","text":"Annual: net profit / average of opening and closing equity (assets). Quarterly: TTM net profit (last 4 quarters) / average of equity (assets) 12 months earlier and at quarter-end. Needs 4 consecutive quarters of data."},{"term":"TTM revenue growth","text":"Last 4 quarters' net sales vs the 4 quarters before that. Needs 8 quarters of data."},{"term":"Debt to equity","text":"(Short term debt + current portion of LT debt + LT debt) / total equity (including minority interest)."},{"term":"Net cash / share","text":"(Cash and bank + short term investments - total borrowings) / shares outstanding."},{"term":"Fiscal years","text":"Each company is compiled on its own fiscal year: June year-end (BFBIO, CPHL, FEROZ, IBLHL, MACTER, OTSU, SEARL) or December (ABOT, AGP, GLAXO, HALEON, HINOON, HPL). FY2025 = year ending Jun-25 or Dec-25. Set in Companies."},{"term":"P/E, P/S, P/B","text":"Market cap = average daily closing price x current shares (prices are bonus-adjusted). Annual: average price over the fiscal year / annual net profit, net sales, FY-end equity. Quarterly: average price for the quarter / TTM net profit, TTM net sales, quarter-end equity."},{"term":"n/a, n/m, blank","text":"n/a = not enough data (e.g. TTM needs 4 quarters; Sep-26 balance sheets not yet in for most companies). n/m = not meaningful (loss or prior-period loss). Blank = period not entered yet."}],"sheetNotes":[{"sheet":"Qtr_Input","text":"THE ONLY PLACE TO ENTER NEW RESULTS. Type in the first empty row under the table: Ticker, quarter-end date, then the 11 figures (standalone quarter, not cumulative). Grey and green columns calculate themselves. Annual figures compile from here. Net profit = attributable to owners where reported; total equity includes minority interest."},{"sheet":"Annual","text":"Compiled from Qtr_Input: P&L = sum of the 4 quarters of each company's own fiscal year (June or December year-end); balance sheet = the FY-end quarter. Only add a row (Ticker + Year) when a new fiscal year starts. P/E, P/B and P/S use the average daily closing price over the fiscal year."},{"sheet":"Compare","text":"Change the yellow cells to switch period. Colours compare companies within each column: valuation (P/E, P/S, P/B) green = cheaper, red = more expensive; other ratios green = stronger. Rank 1 = cheapest. Annual FY = each company's own fiscal year (FY end column). n/a = not enough quarters or no balance sheet yet; n/m = loss."},{"sheet":"Companies","text":"Add a new company here first. Shares outstanding = last 4 quarters' profit to owners / last 4 quarters' EPS (current, bonus-adjusted). FY end month: 6 = June, 12 = December. Blue = input."},{"sheet":"Prices","text":"One row per ticker per day (Ticker, Date, Price). Paste new prices at the bottom; order does not matter. Source: your combined adjusted price sheet."}]},"filings":null,"warnings":7}